It seems that if you kill "The" Goblin King more than once on the same space,
you can run into a neat little bug that puts endless Goblin King Heads on the
space.  By endless I mean that I scrolled through over 20 pages of heads
(2 columns) when doing an "x", and I control-c'd out of it cause I didn't feel
like spending all night reading goblin heads.  I should note that the last time
I killed two Goblin Kings on the same spot the game just locked -- presumably
in an endless loop.

Anybody care to try to find a fix?  I no longer have a copy of the source.

